  data: {
    LLM: "1. Must follow suit. Must overplay (Ylimenopakko): if you can play a higher card than the current winner of the trick, you MUST. 2. Trump: There is no trump until a player who won the previous trick leads a King or Queen and declares a 'Marriage' of that suit. 3. Marriage Values: Spades (40), Clubs (60), Diamonds (80), Hearts (100). Declaring a marriage sets that suit as Trump.",
    Player: "1. Must follow suit. Must overplay (Ylimenopakko): if you can play a higher card than the current winner of the trick, you MUST. 2. Trump: There is no trump until a player who won the previous trick leads a King or Queen and declares a 'Marriage' of that suit. 3. Marriage Values: Spades (40), Clubs (60), Diamonds (80), Hearts (100). Declaring a marriage sets that suit as Trump.",
    objective: 'Be the first partnership to reach 500 points. Points are earned by winning tricks and declaring marriages.',
